| **Positive Tests** | 30-50 tests | Baseline (P) |
| **Negative Tests** | ≥50 AND ≥2×P | Max(50, 2×P) |
| **Edge Cases (Boundary)** | ≥50 AND ≥2×P | Max(50, 2×P) |
| **Functional Tests** | ≥50 (FIXED) | Always 50+ — workflow rules(15), validation rules(15), constraint rules(10), audit rules(10) |
