- ✅ Injection attempts have no effect
- ✅ Authorization checked at every endpoint
- ✅ Audit trail records security events
- ✅ Error messages don't leak sensitive info

**OWASP Top 10 Checklist**:
- [ ] A01: Broken Access Control (IDOR, privilege escalation)
- [ ] A02: Cryptographic Failures (token security)
- [ ] A03: Injection (SQL, XSS, NoSQL, LDAP, Command)
- [ ] A04: Insecure Design (business logic flaws)
- [ ] A05: Security Misconfiguration (defaults, permissions)
- [ ] A06: Vulnerable Components (dependency checks)
- [ ] A07: Authentication Failures (session management)
- [ ] A08: Software and Data Integrity (audit trails)
- [ ] A09: Logging Failures (security event logging)
- [ ] A10: SSRF (if applicable to feature)

