| **No testing** | 0 | 0% | 0 hours | ❌ Unacceptable |
| **Manual sampling** | 10 | 50-60% | 5 hours | ⚠️ Insufficient |
| **Pairwise (2-way)** | 46 | **90-95%** | 10 hours | ✅ **OPTIMAL** |
| **3-way** | 500 | 98-99% | 200 hours | ❌ Diminishing returns |
| **Exhaustive** | 3,125 | 100% | 1,500+ hours | ❌ Impractical |

**ROI Analysis**:
- **Pairwise**: $1,000 investment prevents $50,000 in production defects = **50x ROI**
- **3-way**: $20,000 investment prevents $52,000 in defects = **2.6x ROI**
- **Exhaustive**: $150,000 investment prevents $52,500 in defects = **0.35x ROI** (LOSS)

**Conclusion**: **Pairwise testing is 20x more cost-effective** than 3-way testing.

