## Test Strategy Template

When creating a test strategy document, use this structure:

```markdown
# [Feature Name] Test Strategy

## Test Scope
- Feature description
- Components to test
- Dependencies

## Core Test Categories

### 1. Positive Tests (Target: 40 tests)
**Scenarios**:
- [ ] List of positive test scenarios

