### 2. Negative Tests (Target: ≥50 tests)
**Scenarios**:
- [ ] Invalid inputs
- [ ] Missing required fields
- [ ] Authorization failures
- [ ] Non-existent resources

**Test IDs**: TC-[FEATURE]-NEG-001 through TC-[FEATURE]-NEG-050+

### 3. Edge Cases (Target: ≥50 tests)
**Scenarios**:
- [ ] Boundary values
- [ ] Extreme inputs
- [ ] Timing edge cases
- [ ] Special characters

**Test IDs**: TC-[FEATURE]-EDGE-001 through TC-[FEATURE]-EDGE-050+

### 4. Functional Tests (Target: ≥50 tests)
**Scenarios**:
- [ ] Workflow rules (15): State transitions, pipeline stages, approval flows
- [ ] Validation rules (15): Business rule enforcement, field constraints, cross-field validation
- [ ] Constraint rules (10): Relationship constraints, hierarchy rules, uniqueness rules
- [ ] Audit rules (10): Timestamps, user tracking, change history, soft delete

**Test IDs**: TC-[FEATURE]-FUNC-001 through TC-[FEATURE]-FUNC-050+

### 5. Integration Tests (Target: ≥50 tests)
**Scenarios**:
- [ ] CRUD workflow (10): Create/Read/Update/Delete with real dependencies
- [ ] Search/filter (10): Text search, status filters, date ranges, multi-criteria
- [ ] Pagination (5): Page boundaries, sort ordering, total counts
- [ ] Relationships (10): Parent-child, many-to-many, cascade operations
- [ ] Error handling (15): Not found, conflict, validation error responses

**Test IDs**: TC-[FEATURE]-INT-001 through TC-[FEATURE]-INT-050+

## Additional Test Categories

### ~~6. Validation & Security~~ — OUT OF SCOPE
> Security testing is **out of scope** for the QA team. Handled by Infrastructure and Security teams. See `SECURITY_TESTING_QUESTIONNAIRE.md`.

### 6. Concurrency (Target: ≥25 tests)
**Scenarios**:
- [ ] Concurrent updates
- [ ] Race conditions
- [ ] Double submit
- [ ] Deadlock prevention

**Test IDs**: TC-[FEATURE]-CONC-001 through TC-[FEATURE]-CONC-025+

## Core Total: ~240+ tests
## Grand Total (with Additional): ~315+ tests
## Estimated Effort: [X] hours
## Priority: Critical/High/Medium
