Before starting test implementation, verify:

- [ ] **All 5 core categories included** in test strategy (Positive, Negative, Edge, Functional, Integration)
- [ ] **All additional categories included** (Concurrency, Unit, Performance, Load)
- [ ] **Test count targets** defined for each category
